			"notes": "## KozyClient v2.0.0 (Minecraft 26.2)\n\n### Highlights\n- Engineered for **Minecraft 26.2** on the **Fabric Loader** (0.19.3+).\n- Hardware-accelerated **Dear ImGui** in-game ClickGUI (toggle with `Right Shift`).\n- Interactive, draggable on-screen **HUD Editor** for all widgets.\n- Complete feature set across Combat, Movement, Render / Visuals, Player Automation, and Diagnostics.\n- Integrated low-fire, clean PvP visual enhancements.\n\n### Installation\n1. Install Fabric Loader for Minecraft 26.2.\n2. Place `KozyClient-26.2.jar` (and Fabric API) into your `.minecraft/mods` folder.\n3. Start Minecraft and press `Right Shift` in-game to configure modules.\n\n**Made by [mrKozy](https://github.com/mrKozy)**"
