			"notes": "## KozyClient v1.0.1 (Minecraft 1.21.4)\n\n### Highlights\n- Built for **Minecraft 1.21.4** supporting both **Fabric** and **NeoForge** via MultiLoader architecture.\n- Smooth native **Dear ImGui** overlay windows and ClickGUI (toggle with `Right Shift`).\n- 40+ modular features including KillAura, BowAimbot, Fly, Speed, ESP, Tracers, X-Ray, FullBright, StorageESP, and more.\n- Diagnostic overlays: Coords & FPS, CPS tracker, ArmorHUD, Ping monitor, and Spotify HUD.\n\n### Installation\n1. Install Fabric Loader or NeoForge for Minecraft 1.21.4.\n2. Place `KozyClient-1.21.4.jar` (and Fabric API if on Fabric) into your `.minecraft/mods` folder.\n3. Start Minecraft and press `Right Shift` to open the ClickGUI.\n\n**Made by [mrKozy](https://github.com/mrKozy)**"
